OL,3,GNEWSANew hope for residents 'sick' of
OL,4,Acrime magnet park
OL,5,
OL,6,FHopes are growing that a neglected park
OL,7,Fspace hit by anti-social behaviour
OL,8,Fcould soon be given a new lease of life
OL,9,Fas a sports and leisure facility.
OL,11,FThe land at Scotchman Road in Heaton
OL,12,Fwas once a popular community space,
OL,13,Fbefore it fell into disrepair and
OL,14,Fstarted attracting troublemakers.
OL,16,FLocal campaigner Hamza Rehman recently
OL,17,Flaunched a petition - gathering more
OL,18,Fthan 1,000 signatures - calling for the
OL,19,Fsite to be cleaned up and repurposed.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
